message: "If you use PETRA in academic work, please cite this software."
title: "PETRA — Prime Exponent Tower Recursive Algebra"
abstract: >
  PETRA is an independent prime/exponent interpretation layer over
  the agnostic SHAPES structural core. It includes the Prime
  Interpretation Problem (PIP) and the LRPE interpretation policy.
